  {
   "id": "cbd53t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 32.0,
   "y": 4283,
   "w": 222.0,
   "h": 14,
   "text": "process",
   "anim": {},
   "color": "mute",
   "nav": "process"
  },
  {
   "id": "cbd54t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 270.0,
   "y": 4283,
   "w": 539.3333333333334,
   "h": 14,
   "text": "Twelve concepts, three kept.",
   "anim": {},
   "weight": 700
  },
  {
   "id": "cbd55t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 270.0,
   "y": 4323,
   "w": 539.3333333333334,
   "h": 14,
   "text": "We bodystormed, role-played and mapped “how might we” questions until we had twelve concepts, from wearable energy reflectors to modular partitions for the studio.",
   "anim": {}
  },
  {
   "id": "cbd56t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 270.0,
   "y": 4394,
   "w": 539.3333333333334,
   "h": 14,
   "text": "We scored each one on three questions: is it plausible by 2030, would it improve collaboration, and does it leave room to experiment? Three made it through.",
   "anim": {}
  },
  {
