  {
   "id": "cbd60t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 32.0,
   "y": 4913,
   "w": 222.0,
   "h": 14,
   "text": "nid commons",
   "anim": {},
   "color": "mute",
   "nav": "nid commons"
  },
  {
   "id": "cbd61t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 270.0,
   "y": 4913,
   "w": 539.3333333333334,
   "h": 14,
   "text": "A platform for finding people to work with, and places to work.",
   "anim": {},
   "weight": 700
  },
  {
   "id": "cbd62t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 270.0,
   "y": 4953,
   "w": 539.3333333333334,
   "h": 14,
   "text": "Version 1.0 matched students with a compatibility score built from our research. It fell apart when people who work at different rhythms were paired up.",
   "anim": {}
  },
  {
   "id": "cbd63t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 270.0,
   "y": 5024,
   "w": 539.3333333333334,
   "h": 14,
   "text": "Version 1.1 added SMART goals, so every match started with a shared, concrete aim. Participation evened out, but nothing happened until someone made the first move.",
   "anim": {}
  },
  {
   "id": "cbd64t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 270.0,
   "y": 5095,
   "w": 539.3333333333334,
   "h": 14,
   "text": "Version 1.2 reworked the flow and added a campus map of places to work together. The lesson: a platform can connect people, but it can't give them a reason. Students who arrived without a purpose stalled.",
   "anim": {}
  },
  {
