  {
   "id": "cbd74t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 32.0,
   "y": 6544,
   "w": 222.0,
   "h": 14,
   "text": "flow mediator",
   "anim": {},
   "color": "mute",
   "nav": "flow mediator"
  },
  {
   "id": "cbd75t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 270.0,
   "y": 6544,
   "w": 539.3333333333334,
   "h": 14,
   "text": "An AI companion for group work, tested with a person behind the curtain.",
   "anim": {},
   "weight": 700
  },
  {
   "id": "cbd76t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 270.0,
   "y": 6584,
   "w": 539.3333333333334,
   "h": 14,
   "text": "Flow Mediator started as an ambient system, with adaptive lighting and a voice assistant, that would sense a group's energy and nudge it back into balance.",
   "anim": {}
  },
  {
   "id": "cbd77t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 270.0,
   "y": 6655,
   "w": 539.3333333333334,
   "h": 14,
   "text": "To test the idea without building an AI, we faked one. Ten students worked on an open brief with an “AI” that was really one of us, typing check-ins, guidance and reflective prompts.",
   "anim": {}
  },
  {
   "id": "cbd78t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 270.0,
   "y": 6726,
   "w": 539.3333333333334,
   "h": 14,
   "text": "Reflective students liked having a private, non-judgemental place to think. Expressive students liked quick encouragement. But some leaned on the bot instead of each other. AI can support mentorship, but it can't replace it.",
   "anim": {}
  },
  {
   "id": "cbd79p",
   "type": "image",
   "x": 270,
   "y": 6807,
   "w": 460,
   "h": 325,
   "src": "projects/media/design-process/mediator-storyboard-1.jpg",
   "fit": "cover",
   "alt": "Storyboard of a group session with the Flow Mediator",
   "anim": {
    "enter": {
     "on": true,
     "from": {
      "opacity": 0,
      "y": 40
     },
     "dur": 0.9,
     "delay": 0,
     "ease": "out"
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "cbd80p",
   "type": "image",
   "x": 746,
   "y": 6807,
   "w": 222,
   "h": 325,
   "src": "projects/media/design-process/mediator-woz.jpg",
   "fit": "cover",
   "alt": "A student during the Wizard of Oz test session",
   "anim": {
    "enter": {
     "on": true,
     "from": {
      "opacity": 0,
      "y": 40
     },
     "dur": 0.9,
     "delay": 0.1,
     "ease": "out"
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "cbd81t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 32.0,
   "y": 7262,
   "w": 222.0,
   "h": 14,
   "text": "reflection",
   "anim": {},
   "color": "mute",
   "nav": "reflection"
  },
  {
   "id": "cbd82t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 270.0,
   "y": 7262,
   "w": 539.3333333333334,
   "h": 14,
   "text": "The challenge was never to fix introversion or amplify extroversion.",
   "anim": {},
   "weight": 700
  },
  {
   "id": "cbd83t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 270.0,
   "y": 7302,
   "w": 539.3333333333334,
   "h": 14,
   "text": "It was to design conditions where everyone gets to contribute in their own way. Technology helped connect people, but it couldn't stand in for empathy. Collaboration worked best when the system left room for autonomy and reflection.",
   "anim": {}
  },
  {
   "id": "cbd84t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 270.0,
   "y": 7391,
   "w": 539.3333333333334,
   "h": 14,
   "text": "[Your reflection: two or three sentences in your own voice. What held up, what didn't, and what you'd test next with more than two weeks.]",
   "anim": {}
  }
 ]
}